==Essential improvements==
===Skip intro videos===
{{Fixbox|description=Use the <code>-nomovie</code> [[Glossary:Command line arguments|command line argument]]<ref>
{{Refurl|url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=486470487|title=Steam Community Guides - Skip Intro Movies|date=May 2023}}</ref>}}
{{ii}} Disabled loading screen will remove the loading screen background and faster load into the game.

===Launch the Epic Games version with Steam===
{{ii}} [https://github.com/jun-eau/Slipstream Slipstream] is a standalone launcher that allows the game to run without the Epic Games Launcher running in the background.
{{ii}} Restores Steam Overlay, Steam Input controller configurations, and Steam Deck compatibility for the Epic Games version.

{{Fixbox|description=Setup Slipstream|fix=
# Navigate to the Slipstream repository (linked above) and download the latest executable from the '''Releases''' page.
# Place the executable in a dedicated folder (this is where its config will be generated).
# In Steam, click '''Add a Game''' -> '''Add a Non-Steam Game...''' and select the executable. (Linux/Steam Deck users have to go to Compatibility and force the use of the latest Proton).
# Launch the shortcut through Steam and follow the prompts to locate <code>RocketLeague.exe</code> and authenticate your Epic account via the browser.
}}

